  "sections": [
    {
      "tag": "header",
      "cls": "sb-globalNav",
      "text": "MENU\nREWARDS\nGIFT CARDS\nFind a store\nSign in\nJoin now",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "It's a great day for coffee Start an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "New: Blue coconut for a cause\nHelp support clean water access for people in need with the new Blue Coconut Lemonade Energy Refresher and Iced Blue Coconut Matcha.* Available for a limited time.\nOrder now",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "It’s Starbucks summer\nEnticing new flavors and returning favorites are here so you can savor the season to the very last drop. Experience new Tropical Butterfly Refreshers, reunite with Horchata and more.\nExplore the summer menu",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Bold, iced and deliciously classic\nTry a cold-coffee favorite like Iced Brown Sugar Oatmilk Shaken Espresso, Toasted Coconut Cream Cold Brew or Vanilla Sweet Cream Cold Brew.\nOrder a cold coffee",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Good energy in every sip\nHandcrafted with B vitamins and extra caffeine sourced from nature, our Energy Refreshers are here to quench your thirst and boost your afternoon.\nTry one now",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "One night with Myles Smith\nWin exclusive access to see singer-songwriter Myles Smith live at the Starbucks Reserve Roastery in NYC on August 14, 2026.**\nEnter sweepstakes",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "*For all modifications of Iced Blue Coconut Matcha and Blue Coconut Refresher purchased between June 16, 2026, and July 7, 2026, in participating U.S. stores and on the Starbucks® app, Starbucks will donate $0.25 to Water.org (www.water.org). This donation will be used to help provide lasting access to clean water and sanitation for people around the world, providing up to 195,000 people with access to clean water or sanitation through a maximum donation of $975,000.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "**NO PURCHASE NECESSARY. Legal residents of the 50 U.S. (D.C.) 21 years or older. Ends 7/14/26. To enter and for Official Rules, including odds, and prize descriptions, visit MylesSmith.MarriottBonvoy.Starbucks.com. Void where prohibited.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
